# Go Base Template — Mimari Kuralları

Yatay katmanlı monolit (NotificationApi düzeni). Stack: Fiber v2, GORM/Postgres
(code-first Fluent + versioned migrations), Redis, ozzo-validation, OpenAPI (swaggo).
GraphQL: ayrı branch `feature/graphql` (main'de yok).

## Yasaklar

- Repository / UoW yok — `*gorm.DB` doğrudan `services/{resource}/` içinde
- Outbox / `cmd/` / `internal/` / `platform/` / `features/` / `consumers/` / `endpoints/` / `events/` yok
- RabbitMQ / outbound HTTP client / domain event dispatcher yok
- `"Get"` öneki yok (`Todos`, `TodoById`)
- Ham `error` handler'dan sızmaz — `*apperr.Error` + `apperr.WriteHTTP`
- Hata `code` string'leri hardcoded değil — `constants/` (`TODO_NOT_FOUND`, …)
- Fat controller yok — ince handler + `Register(api)`
- Entity üzerinde kolon/type GORM tag yok — şema Fluent map (`Columns` + `Migrate`)
- Shadow kolon struct yasak — `AutoMigrate(entity)` + `ApplyColumns`
- Entity `mappings` import etmez (cycle); `TableName` map ile aynı string
- `AutoMigrate` sadece map `Migrate` / migration `Up` içinde
- ent yok
- Elle OpenAPI YAML yok — `make openapi`

## Dizin

```text
src/main.go
src/config/
src/extensions/          # AddDatabase, AddRedis, health, OpenAPI
src/docs/
src/common/              # Model, WriteJSON, apperr, logger
src/constants/
src/interfaces/          # Cache
src/controllers/v1/      # ince handler + Register(api)
src/services/{resource}/ (+ validations/)
src/services/cache/
src/data/
  ensure.go  postgres.go  migrate.go
  migrations/  entities/  mappings/
src/models/requests|responses/
```

İsimlendirme: [STRUCTURE.md](../STRUCTURE.md).

## Prensipler

- Code-first Fluent: entity alanları + map `Columns`/`Migrate`
- Startup: `data.Setup` → DB yoksa oluştur → pending migration → `schema_migrations`
- HTTP: `controllers/v1` — `Register(api)` path'leri handler ile birlikte
- Controller ince: decode → service → `WriteJSON` / `WriteHTTP`
- Validation: `services/{resource}/validations/`
- OpenAPI: annotation → `make openapi`
- GraphQL: `feature/graphql` branch
